 "cost_usd": 0.000193,
 "narrative": "## The trajectory\nRevenue was $51.8B in FY2025 [1].\nRevenue CAGR was +9.1% over FY2016..FY2025 [2].\nNet income was $8.0B in FY2025 [3].\n\n## Growth quality\nRevenue growth in FY2025 was +4.9% [1] [4].\nNet income growth in FY2025 was -13.6% [3] [5].\nIn FY2025, net income growth of -13.6% [3] [5] was below revenue growth of +4.9% [1] [4].\n\n## Margins\nNet margin was 15.4% in FY2025 [6].\nNet margin changed -3.3pp in FY2025 [6] [7].\nNet margin changed -3.9pp in FY2024 [7] [8].\n\n## Cash & balance sheet\nIn FY2022, free cash flow of $18.2B [9] was below net income of $18.7B [10].\nThe current ratio was 1.30\u00d7 in FY2025 [11], above 1.00\u00d7.\nIn FY2025, operating cash flow of $19.8B [12] was above net income of $8.0B [3].\nCash & equivalents was $6.5B in FY2025 [13].\n\n## Red flags\nNet margin compressed 7.2pp over three periods: 22.6% \u2192 18.7% \u2192 15.4%. Source operands: Net margin 22.6% in FY2023 [8]; Net margin 18.7% in FY2024 [7]; Net margin 15.4% in FY2025 [6].\n\n## What to watch next\nWatch whether revenue growth in the next reporting update improves from +4.9% in FY2025 [1] [4].\nWatch how net income in the next reporting update compares with $8.0B in FY2025 [3].\nWatch how free cash flow in the next reporting update compares with $18.2B in FY2022 [9].",
